  "cited_article_id": "create-custom-lab-panels",
  "reply": "Only a clinical administrator can create a shared panel. Go to Clinical Setup > Lab Management > Order Panels, click “Create New Panel,” enter a panel name and specialty, add the desired tests (up to 25) using the search bar, then click “Save and Publish.” After publishing, ensure the panel’s sharing permissions include the providers’ department under Settings > Permissions > Lab Access so it appears in their order menu."
}
